	(descr "Bosch Sensortec BMP390 barometric pressure sensor, 10-pin metal-lid LGA 2.0 x 2.0 x 0.75 mm. Land pattern per datasheet BST-BMP390-DS002-07 Rev 1.7 section 7.2, which directs that the package outline dimensions (Fig 26 bottom view) be used AS the landing pattern - so copper is 1:1 with the package pads, no expansion. Pads at radial offset 0.7625 (=1.525/2); 6x 0.275 x 0.250 on the left/right columns, 4x 0.250 x 0.275 on the top/bottom rows. Drawn in TOP view per Fig 23; pin 1 (VDDIO) at TOP RIGHT. F.Fab circle marks the 0.25mm port hole - it must not be obstructed.")
	(tags "Bosch BMP390 BMP388 LGA-10 barometer pressure sensor")
